    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Losted Mind is a linear first-person shooter with horror elements. The game takes place in our time. The main character is a man experiencing mental problems, at some point, as it seems to him, beginning to lose touch with reality. Monsters burst into his already troubled life. Break through the monsters, do not stop at anything. Go through this path with the main character to understand whether everything that appears before your eyes is reality. Shoot monsters, look for plot clues, read notes to fully grasp the plot. Throughout the game you will see only three types of weapons, save ammo.</p>",
